{"title":"Feign 更换 Client","uid":"d266364635de3b3a7fe3a7b3d3df196e","slug":"feign/Feign 更换 Client","date":"2025-02-09T18:51:22.000Z","updated":"2025-03-30T03:52:57.826Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/feign/Feign 更换 Client.json","keywords":null,"cover":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"基于-loadBalancer-更换-FeignClient-为-vertx-web-实现\"><a href=\"#基于-loadBalancer-更换-FeignClient-为-vertx-web-实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"基于 loadBalancer 更换 FeignClient 为 vertx-web 实现\"></a>基于 loadBalancer 更换 FeignClient 为 vertx-web 实现</h2><ul>\n<li>feignClient 实现类依旧是 LoadBalancerFeignClient</li>\n<li>LoadBalancerFeignClient 中 delegate 更换为自定义实现的 vertx-web-client</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"shiki Java\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre><code>public class VertxFeignClient implements Client {\n\n    private final WebClient webClient;\n\n    public VertxFeignClient() {\n        Vertx vertx = Vertx.vertx();\n        WebClientOptions webClientOptions = new WebClientOptions()\n                .setMaxPoolSize(100)\n                .setMaxWaitQueueSize(10000);\n        this.webClient = WebClient.create(vertx, webClientOptions);\n    }\n\n    @Override\n    public Response execute(Request request, Request.Options options) throws IOException {\n        String url = request.url();\n        var bodys = request.requestBody().asBytes();\n        Map<String, Collection<String>> headers = request.headers();\n        io.vertx.core.http.HttpMethod vertxMethod = io.vertx.core.http.HttpMethod.valueOf(request.httpMethod().name());\n\n        HeadersMultiMap entries = new HeadersMultiMap();\n        headers.forEach(entries::add);\n\n        CompletableFuture<Response> completableFuture = new CompletableFuture<>();\n\n        webClient.requestAbs(vertxMethod, url)\n                .putHeaders(entries)\n                .sendBuffer(bodys == null ? Buffer.buffer() : Buffer.buffer(bodys))\n                .timeout(options.readTimeoutMillis(), TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS)\n                .onSuccess(t -> {\n                    log.info(\"url[{}] 响应 -> {}\", url, t.bodyAsString());\n                    MultiMap responseHeaders = t.headers();\n                    Map<String, Collection<String>> map = new HashMap<>();\n                    responseHeaders.forEach((k, v) -> map.put(k, Collections.singleton(v)));\n                    completableFuture.complete(Response.builder()\n                            .status(t.statusCode())\n                            .reason(t.statusMessage())\n                            .headers(map)\n                            .body(t.bodyAsBuffer().getBytes())\n                            .request(request)\n                            .build());\n                }).onFailure(completableFuture::completeExceptionally);\n\n        try {\n            return completableFuture.get();\n        } catch (InterruptedException | ExecutionException e) {\n            throw new RuntimeException(e);\n        }\n    }\n}</code></pre></div></div></figure>\n\n<ul>\n<li>配置类装配 FeignClient bean</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"shiki Java\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre><code>@Configuration\npublic class VertxFeignClientConfiguration {\n\n    @Bean\n    @Primary\n    public Client feignClient(CachingSpringLoadBalancerFactory cachingFactory,\n                              SpringClientFactory clientFactory) {\n        return new LoadBalancerFeignClient(new VertxFeignClient(), cachingFactory, clientFactory);\n    }\n\n}</code></pre></div></div></figure>\n","text":"基于 loadBalancer 更换 FeignClient 为 vertx-web 实现 feignClient 实现类依旧是 LoadBalancerFei...","permalink":"/post/feign/Feign 更换 Client","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"2.7k","symbolsTime":"2 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"feign","slug":"feign","count":3,"path":"api/categories/feign.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"feign","slug":"feign","count":3,"path":"api/tags/feign.json"},{"name":"rpc","slug":"rpc","c